.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x260","subtitle":"Rows separated by a whisper of the text color; status cells reuse the tags","name":"Table"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x380","subtitle":"Text inputs, a segmented control and radios — native elements, themed states","name":"Forms"},{"path":"components/icons/icons.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Phosphor duotone on currentColor — the twelve glyphs the source ships","name":"Icons"},{"path":"components/navigation/navigation.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"A header bar over a left page opening","name":"Navigation"},{"path":"components/print/print.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"CMYK plates, the halftone screen, plate-set numerals and the head rules","name":"Print treatments"},{"path":"components/surfaces/surfaces.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x400","subtitle":"Surface-filled cards, the three elevations, and the modal at the top of the stack","name":"Cards & dialog"},{"path":"ui_kits/daybreak/index.html","group":"Daybreak","viewport":"1200x760","subtitle":"The system's own product surface: masthead, plate-set hero, dateline rail, columns, plate photograph, subscribe flow, back issues and preferences","name":"Daybreak — front page"},{"path":"guidelines/interaction.html","group":"Interaction","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Hover one ramp step darker (600), pressed 700; outlined/ghost hover = 7–10% ink or accent tint; focus = 2px accent ring offset 2; disabled 45%; selection accent 30%","name":"States"},{"path":"guidelines/radius-elevation.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Radius 1 / 2 / 4px — near-square; three ink-tinted shadows tuned to the paper ground","name":"Radius & elevation"},{"path":"guidelines/rules.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"No dividers between sections. The exception: front-page hea